<title>LATVIA: SOCCER-SKONTO WIN LATVIAN CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SKONTO WIN LATVIAN CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the Latvian</p>
<p>cup, played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>    Skonto   2   - Mikhail Mikholap 55, Marian Pahars 71</p>
<p>    Dinaburg 1   - Eduard Burlakov 41</p>
<p>Halftime 0-1</p>
